  "pack": {
    "id": "lobby-stk2-bunker",
    "version": "8",
    "description": "the STK2 bomb shelter (2011-12 scenario a03_bomb_shelter: its octagonal store room with its shelves, crates and beds, and the vaults beside it) as a 0.26g lobby project, projects/lobby_scene/stk2_bunker, lit by STK2's own lights, sun and post-process; the character's spot 0.25 m clear of the crates and the leaf pile beside it left out (the squad's left member stood in it), camera boxes over the floor and around the props the lobby camera got into, the weapon 0.40 m above the metal boxes; @3: relit warm (the owner's pick): a box probe of the room from a warm-neutral gradient, STK2's three wide fills shortened and warmed short of orange, a warm light under each street lamp (the one behind the character shadowed, the character lit all the way round), the lamps' shades glowing (STK2's unlit lamp_street given its emissive variant, emitting its texture), a camera box across the front arch to the next vault; @4: the whole shelter (the slice's box grown to x 24..63, z -36..6: its corridors, vaults and rooms beyond the store room's doorways, which showed the sky through the cut), their lamps as warm; a dim warm light in each vault beyond the room's arches (they showed black); @5: the weapon of an upgrade window in the air in front of the character, beside him (lobby (-0.95, 1.35, -0.80), seen along +z as the stock camera looks; the shelter has no table, and above the metal boxes by the south wall it hung before a bed frame); the textures at their STK2 sources' full size (to 2048 px: up to @4 they were scaled to 512 px, the props' to 256, and looked fuzzy up close); the wheeled cart by the leaning plank left out, and its camera box; @6: lamps with fixtures, softer light (the owner: \"the lightbulbs are missing completely\", \"not just bulbs, plafonds too\", \"the lighting too is a bit too sharp\"): STK2's street lamps (one surface each, a shade or a cage, no bulb) left out and 0.26's own fixtures at their spots, drawn only: a pendant (props/light/green_lamp_with_wire, its enamel shade, with a glowing bulb props/light/lamp_on in its socket) where STK2 hung an open shade, a caged ceiling plafond (props/light/plafon_lamp and its glowing glass plafon_lamp_on) where it hung a cage; the store room's three lights at their fixtures, 2.4 (3.2), 8.5 m (6), falloff power 1.5 (2); the room probe's ambient 0.3 (0.2); @7: the lights at the pendants cast no shadow (the store room's lamp_0 and STK2's light under the corridor pendant: their shades threw a pitch-black ellipse over the vault above them; the light now reaches the ceiling as a real lamp's bounce does), the room probe's ambient 0.45 (0.3) so the shadows are lighter; the merged model is new with each version (level/stk2_bunker/main_v7), so no surface of an earlier version is left in it; @8: no light casts a shadow (the owner: a hard pitch-black band down the inner face of the big arch, \"a shadow of something\": the shelf post by the gas-mask crates, 1.7 m from STK2's store-room fill point_light(5), which stands right beside the shelf; the other fills and the vault glows alike), and the main lights 18 % lower (the owner: \"decrease intensity of light a bit\"): the store room's three lamps 2.0 (2.4), the fills and the vault glows by the same share; the ambient and the bulbs' glow kept"
  },
